{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000025393","bookName":"El hijo perdido de Zeus ha regresado","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000025393/42000025393.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1107897,"followCount":28139,"introduction":"Hércules, hijo de Zeus y Hera, desapareció de niño tras ser intercambiado por el mortal Ícaro. Dieciocho años después, llega al Olimpo para competir por un puesto entre los Guardianes Divinos y salvar a su amada Irene. Allí demuestra un talento muy superior al de Ícaro. Sin conocer su verdadera identidad, su propia familia lo humilla y lo destierra. Cuando la verdad sale a la luz, todos suplican su perdón, mientras Ícaro se alía con Hades para vengarse.","chapterCount":53,"labels":["Comeback Story","Divine Tycoon"],"tags":["Comeback Story","Divine Tycoon"],"typeTwoIds":[309],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":309,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"El-hijo-perdido-de-Zeus-ha-regresado","bookNameLower":"el-hijo-perdido-de-zeus-ha-regresado","shelfTime":"2026-08-28 00:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-08-28 00:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701512239","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/93/3x9/39x3/393x5/39352000024/701512239_1/701512239.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=J0vNY1yglCv6ajh80C0o-1n073LvsDdblDwLraTEjtd5n20-ndTmYO8F8C6akwOFReIFJErkJ7-NsZ2ylWYs2Msu1pVAJkjqrN-~gcYAKeoCdHdWwPWpYkLK7rALre35QuN-FC2PM-ESpt5tpvcv7Eqdl3N1zG3PsMWD9e~A6iOulspo8xfZOIpm8pogOcOE91PKLikrhNYs2DoQSAvJ5AIljtkIDrYTa-4dJw0B6ayHMjEJMf-YbGm6GbNOBhJXWt7KVxR1QcRKWlXOoDxXXM-6uFbTeeglx1in9SEr5lsIjeyZWjC~~LI381ebIQBAaKweOQB8yVqB6Rs~znQXjw__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/93/3x9/39x3/393x5/39352000024/701512239_1/701512239.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":226462,"price":0},{"id":"701512240","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvi